      "uid": "zhcn:e1646e78c2d421df31c6014c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，只要我在这次的集训中好好努力，\n一定可以变得十分耀眼，\n甚至能赢过前一个世代，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f58eb8ebe62e2e9437d4c77651a5c9a0340a1056c5f60b1b5bd72bb8e71014f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
