      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02b4c1afa3106acd19816e94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……她能力的进步幅度没有以前那么大了。\n和经典级这个成长的巅峰时期相比，\n或许是理所当然的，但……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdadad7bb6929f81eb08a5e4e8e6971ca649dc84d4e65158f8616804279441f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
